### META
directory_path: install/_webui.sh/frontend/sections
description: Modular frontend page directories for DINS WebUI
created: 2025-01-28
modified: 2025-11-29
status: active
notes: Sections are loaded dynamically by index.html based on API discovery. Each section must have page.html and page.js.

### DIRECTORIES
admin_security/ | Admin authentication and security settings UI
audio_stack/ | Audio service stack configuration UI
cluster_swarm/ | Docker Swarm cluster configuration UI
devices_audio/ | Audio device discovery and configuration UI
devices_bluetooth/ | Bluetooth device discovery and pairing UI
devices_other/ | Other device types configuration UI
devices_video/ | Video/camera device configuration UI
enhancements_stack/ | Enhancement services configuration UI
llm_cloud/ | Cloud LLM provider configuration UI
llm_local/ | Local LLM provider configuration UI
mobile_stack/ | Mobile app integration configuration UI
network_ssh/ | Network scanning and SSH node discovery UI
nodes_selection/ | Node selection and role assignment UI
services/ | Swarm service management UI per PART 9
stt_engine/ | Speech-to-Text engine selection UI
stt_input/ | STT input sources and microphone configuration UI
tts_routing/ | Text-to-Speech output routing configuration UI
vpn_mesh_stack/ | VPN and mesh networking configuration UI
web_stack/ | Web services stack configuration UI

### SECTION_STRUCTURE
Each section directory contains:
- page.html: HTML markup for the section
- page.js: JavaScript logic for API interaction
- .index: Section documentation

### DYNAMIC_LOADING
index.html discovers sections via:
1. Fetching /api/sections endpoint
2. Loading page.html into content area
3. Executing page.js for interactivity
